      <fieldText
      >&lt;h2&gt;Elapsed time versus working time&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Friday 28 August 16:30 to Tuesday 1 September 09:30 spans &lt;b&gt;89 elapsed hours&lt;/b&gt;, but only &lt;b&gt;1 working hour&lt;/b&gt; in London: weekdays 09:00–17:00, with Monday a holiday.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Change either date or timezone, then compare both actions. Reverse the endpoints to get negative durations.&lt;/p&gt;</fieldText>
      <fieldType>DisplayText</fieldType>
    </fields>
